{'symbol': 'PHM', 'date': '2021-12-21 08:30:00', 'title': "PURPLE HEART RECIPIENT RECEIVES NEW MORTGAGE-FREE HOME IN CHARLOTTE, THANKS TO PULTEGROUP'S BUILT TO HONOR® PROGRAM", 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--IN A CELEBRATORY EVENT, U.S. ARMY SERGEANT FIRST CLASS CARL ROUSH WAS PRESENTED WITH THE KEYS TO HIS NEW MORTGAGE-FREE PULTE HOME IN THE SOUTHSTONE COMMUNITY IN STALLINGS, NORTH CAROLINA. THE HOME WAS BUILT AND DONATED THROUGH PULTEGROUP'S BUILT TO HONOR® PROGRAM, WHICH PROVIDES THE GIFT OF A NEW HOME TO WOUNDED VETERANS AND THEIR FAMILIES ACROSS THE COUNTRY. “WE ARE PROUD TO WELCOME ARMY SERGEANT FIRST CLASS ROUSH AND HIS FAMILY TO THEIR NEW HOME AS AN EXPRESS"}